@TiendaPromElec_HostAddress = https://localhost:5001

### Registro
POST {{TiendaPromElec_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Cliente Demo",
  "email": "demo@promelec.com",
  "password": "Demo#2025!"
}

### Login (admin por defecto)
POST {{TiendaPromElec_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@promelec.com",
  "password": "Admin#2025!"
}

### Listar productos (público)
GET {{TiendaPromElec_HostAddress}}/api/Product

### Crear producto (requiere token de admin)
POST {{TiendaPromElec_HostAddress}}/api/Product
Authorization: Bearer <PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Producto Demo",
  "description": "Producto de prueba",
  "brand": "DemoBrand",
  "price": 100.50,
  "stock": 10,
  "imageUrl": "https://via.placeholder.com/300",
  "categoryId": 1
}
